> 🚀 A professional, automated data analysis tool that cleans, analyzes, visualizes, and summarizes your CSV files — in one simple command.

---

## ✨ Overview

**Professional CSV Analyzer v2.0** is a one-stop solution for quick and intelligent data analysis.  
It automatically performs **data cleaning, correlation visualization, distribution analysis, animated trend visualization**, and **full HTML EDA reporting** — perfect for professionals, data engineers, and analysts.

---

## 📸 Demo Preview

| Correlation Heatmap | Animated Trend |
|----------------------|----------------|
| ![Heatmap](correlation_heatmap.png) | ![Animated Trend](animated_trend.gif) |

---

## 🧩 Features

✅ **Smart Summary** — automatic overview of data shape, missing values, and column details  
✅ **Data Cleaning** — removes duplicates & fills missing values with median or “Unknown”  
✅ **Professional Visualizations**
- Correlation heatmap  
- Distribution histograms  
- Animated trend GIF  

✅ **Auto EDA Report** — full HTML report generated using `ydata_profiling`  
✅ **Clean Outputs** — saves cleaned CSV and all visuals in your working directory  

---

## ⚙️ Installation

### 1️⃣ Clone this Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/GLITCHINvision/Professional_CSV_Analyzer.git
cd Professional_CSV_Analyzer

Install Required Libraries
pip install pandas numpy matplotlib seaborn ydata-profiling pillow

Usage
Basic Command:
python pro_analyze_csv.py <path_to_your_csv>

Example:
python pro_analyze_csv.py "C:\Users\Hp\Downloads\data.csv"

After execution, the script will generate all results in your current directory.

📁 Output Files
FileDescriptioncleaned_data.csvCleaned dataset after removing duplicates & missing valuescorrelation_heatmap.pngVisual heatmap of feature correlationsfeature_distributions.pngDistribution of numerical featuresanimated_trend.gifAnimated trend line for key numeric columnanalysis_report.htmlFull interactive profiling report (HTML)

🧱 Project Structure
Professional_CSV_Analyzer/
│
├── pro_analyze_csv.py          # Main Python analysis script
├── cleaned_data.csv            # Cleaned dataset output
├── correlation_heatmap.png     # Correlation visualization
├── feature_distributions.png   # Histogram plots
├── animated_trend.gif          # Animated trend visualization
└── analysis_report.html        # Full profiling report


